      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "6193"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d0a2968535a4bdf6b065aa5",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "介绍一下人气第二吧\n%h_pop2",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd9a92a4feddf374d4e9e806925b6c70076c145b3da6854e0a2607ee5c658af7",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "6194"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4115e3b5642fa5ee5a8fdbc0",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "实力毫不逊色，\\n人气第二，%h_pop2",
      "source_fingerprint": "48ce9ac7c5da9402997675750b6d2d2c3bc0b841d75042e936392b1ea79e2398",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "6195"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:22aef2aa5a50ae9d9c52efb5",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "威风堂堂地等待着起跑的是这位赛马娘\\n今天的人气第一%h_pop1！",
      "source_fingerprint": "486c84ceb28fa9e9088ba9ca007a63d89edd89619d3407bbdb584c613a74eeaa",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "6196"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f918cc75b0c1ad2cdecb6bcc",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "今天的主角之位非这位赛马娘莫属。\\n人气第一%h_pop1！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2cfce5652c2c60fc85aee7bb9fedcaa2fa513adaabe74225a9b46519bc01d03b",
